{"id":1396,"imdb":"tt0072443","en":"Mirror","orig":"Зеркало","ar":"مرآة","tag":null,"ov":"في هذا العمل السينمائي التجريبي، يقدم المخرج أندريه تاركوفسكي رحلة تأملية ذاتية تتجاوز البناء السردي التقليدي. يدمج الفيلم ذكريات الطفولة، وأحلاماً متداخلة، ولقطات وثائقية تاريخية، في سياق يعكس تدفق الذاكرة البشرية. من خلال مزيج من المشاهد البصرية الشاعرية وإلقاء القصائد، يستعرض الفيلم انعكاسات الهوية الشخصية والوطنية وتأثير الذاكرة على تشكيل وعي الفرد، ليقدم تجربة سينمائية فلسفية فريدة.","rd":"1975-03-07","rt":107,"g":[18,36],"lang":"ru","budget":825000,"revenue":124367,"companies":[{"n":"Mosfilm","logo":"/xenuUvcunUNpbaDOYGhWZERaym7.png","c":"SU"}],"countries":["SU"],"langs":["Russian","Spanish"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"SU","d":"1975-03-07"},{"c":"FR","d":"1978-01-18"},{"c":"FI","d":"1978-04-21"},{"c":"SE","d":"1979-11-12"},{"c":"DK","d":"1980-07-11"},{"c":"US","d":"1983-08-17"},{"c":"DE","d":"1989-11-17"},{"c":"XC","d":"1990-03-01"},{"c":"BR","d":"2005-03-07"},{"c":"CZ","d":"2007-01-11"},{"c":"RU","d":"2008-12-04"},{"c":"PT","d":"2009-03-14"},{"c":"NL","d":"2019-09-19"},{"c":"MX","d":"2021-11-16"},{"c":"PA","d":"2022-03-18"}],"dir":["Andrei Tarkovsky"],"prod":[],"wri":["Aleksandr Misharin","Andrei Tarkovsky"],"mus":["Eduard Artemyev","Johann Sebastian Bach","Henry Purcell","Giovanni Battista Pergolesi"],"dop":["Georgi Rerberg"],"cast":[{"n":"Margarita Terekhova","ch":"Natalya / Maroussia - the Mother","p":"/G9FgIWxn0BNwUXeyBguCagzwQG.jpg"},{"n":"Ignat Daniltsev","ch":"Ignat / Alexei - 12 Years Old","p":"/cf63G5PBEcqVWcHcgkWoTFZ0PU0.jpg"},{"n":"Larisa Tarkovskaya","ch":"Nadezha","p":null},{"n":"Alla Demidova","ch":"Lisa","p":"/b5gVC4NBaoouPF0DMrAEfhEbU30.jpg"},{"n":"Anatoliy Solonitsyn","ch":"Forensic Doctor","p":"/37Vb7vNMHAz1s2WI5kW4BHt0X0N.jpg"},{"n":"Mykola Hrynko","ch":"Printery Director","p":"/n8lxXQbLYOed7AeowxA49yB2jyS.jpg"},{"n":"Tamara Ogorodnikova","ch":"Nanny / Neighbour / Strange Woman at Tea Table","p":"/dpSKediIMxmz6L9rZzxthVDpgeK.jpg"},{"n":"Yuriy Nazarov","ch